  "changes": [
    "Retain cloud account-scoped media URLs and idempotent prepare/save/update/delete requests.",
    "Source modal markup and labels replace the combined editor. Date/caption edits retain all other metadata.",
    "Source camera uses snapshot-local asset paths. Calendar uses snapshot-local imports and omits diary markers without an account-scoped marker capture.",
    "Source snapshot facts show rounded BMI, while stored precision stays unchanged.",
    "Options navigation forwards to the mounted app navigation.",
    "Camera CSS final blank line removed; remaining copied styles are unchanged.",
    "Copied text assets use LF line endings so working and published Git bytes match.",
    "Shared calendar now accepts account-scoped async monthly markers; this surface keeps marker-free selection and cancellation. See diary-calendar-source.json."
  ],
